    "第1話。真琴が弘前でバスを降り、物語の舞台となる下湯口地区へ入る場面。": "Episode 1. The scene where Makoto gets off the bus in Hirosaki and enters the Shimoyuguchi district, the setting of the story.",
    "第1話。横浜から青森へ来た真琴が弘前に到着する場面。": "Episode 1. The scene where Makoto, who has traveled from Yokohama to Aomori, arrives in Hirosaki.",
    "第1話。弘前駅到着後、真琴がバスへ乗り継ぐ駅前の場面。": "Episode 1. The scene in front of the station where Makoto transfers to a bus after arriving at Hirosaki Station.",
    "第1話。弘前市内を移動する際の橋周辺の街路景観として登場。": "Episode 1. Appears as the streetscape around a bridge while traveling through Hirosaki City.",
    "第1話。下湯口バス停周辺で真琴が親戚宅方面へ向かう場面。": "Episode 1. The scene where Makoto heads toward her relatives’ house near the Shimo-Yuguchi bus stop.",
    "第1話。真琴たちが買い物に訪れる商業施設のモデルとして登場。": "Episode 1. Appears as the model for the shopping center where Makoto and her friends go shopping.",
    "OP・第1話。紙漉沢地区の橋と田園風景が印象的な背景として登場。": "Opening Sequence & Episode 1. The bridge and rural scenery of the Kamisukizawa district appear as a striking backdrop.",
    "第1話。真琴たちが通う学校の外観モデルとして登場。現役校のため敷地内巡礼は不可。": "Episode 1. Appears as the exterior model for the school Makoto and her friends attend. As it is an active school, touring the campus is not permitted.",
    "第1話。学校周辺の移動シーンで弘前駐屯地付近の道路景観が登場。施設内への立入は不可。": "Episode 1. Roadscapes near the Hirosaki Garrison appear in scenes where the characters are moving around the school area. Entry into the facility is not permitted.",
    "OP・第2話・第5話。下湯口地区の三叉路が複数回背景として登場。": "Opening sequence, Episode 2, and Episode 5. The three-way intersection in the Shimoyuguchi district appears multiple times as a background.",
    "OP・第3話。真琴がカラスを呼ぶ魔法を試す場面などで境内が登場。": "Opening sequence and Episode 3. The shrine grounds appear in scenes such as when Makoto tries out her magic to summon a crow.",
    "OP・第7話。喫茶コンクルシオに関係する印象的な洋館・喫茶室の舞台として登場。": "Opening Sequence and Episode 7. Appears as the setting for the striking Western-style mansion and café associated with Café Concursio.",
    "第1話・第2話。弘前らしいりんご畑や岩木山を望む風景として登場。": "Episodes 1 and 2. Appears as a landscape featuring apple orchards and a view of Mount Iwaki, characteristic of Hirosaki.",
    "第2話。真琴たちが訪れる神社として楼門や境内が描かれる。": "Episode 2. The shrine gate and shrine grounds are depicted as the shrine Makoto and her friends visit.",
    "第2話。下乗橋越しに弘前城を望む構図が登場。": "Episode 2. A shot featuring Hirosaki Castle viewed across the Shimo-Nobori Bridge appears.",
    "第2話。弘前公園内の植物園が背景として登場。開園期間・入園条件に従う。": "Episode 2. The botanical garden within Hirosaki Park appears as a background. Please observe the park’s opening hours and admission policies.",
    "第2話。五重塔で知られる最勝院周辺の景観が登場。": "Episode 2. The scenery around Saishō-in Temple, known for its five-story pagoda, appears.",
    "第2話。青柳地区を移動する場面で旧青柳小学校周辺の道路景観が登場。": "Episode 2. Roadscapes around the former Aoyagi Elementary School appear in a scene where the characters are traveling through the Aoyagi district.",
    "第2話・第7話。下湯口奥の三叉路が日常の移動場面に繰り返し登場。": "Episodes 2 and 7. The three-way intersection at the back of Shimoyuguchi appears repeatedly in everyday travel scenes.",
    "第5話。使い魔のチトが一人で散歩する途中に歩く道路として登場。": "Episode 5. The road appears as the path Chito, the familiar, walks along while taking a solo stroll.",
    "第5話。チトの散歩ルートで寺沢川沿いの緑地が登場。": "Episode 5. The green space along the Terasawa River appears as part of Chito’s walking route.",
    "第5話。下湯口地区の散歩・移動シーンで地域施設が登場。利用目的のない館内立入は避ける。": "Episode 5. Local facilities appear in walking and travel scenes set in the Shimoyuguchi district. Please avoid entering the buildings unless you have a specific purpose for doing so.",
    "第5話。チトが散歩する途中の橋として登場。": "Episode 5. A bridge appears as part of Chito’s walking route.",
    "第5話。チトの散歩ルートにある東屋と周辺景観が登場。処理施設内部には立ち入らない。": "Episode 5. A gazebo and the surrounding scenery along Chito’s walking route appear. Do not enter the interior of the treatment facility.",
    "第7話。学校施設の外観・周辺景観が登場。現役校のため敷地内への巡礼目的の立入は不可。": "Episode 7. The exterior of a school facility and the surrounding scenery appear. As this is an active school, entry onto the grounds for pilgrimage purposes is prohibited.",
    "第7話。西目屋村へ向かう場面で下大秋地区入口の道路景観が登場。": "Episode 7. The roadside scenery at the entrance to the Shimo-Oaki district appears in a scene heading toward Nishimeya Village.",
    "第12話。放送当時の吉井酒造煉瓦倉庫が登場。現在は改修され弘前れんが倉庫美術館として活用されている。": "Episode 12. The Yoshii Sake Brewery brick warehouse as it appeared at the time of broadcast is featured. It has since been renovated and is now used as the Hirosaki Brick Warehouse Art Museum.",
    "第12話。土淵川周辺を歩く場面で小橋と街並みが登場。": "Episode 12. A small bridge and the townscape appear in a scene where the characters walk along the Tsuchibuchi River.",
    "第12話。手芸店『しまや』の店舗外観が登場。営業時間・店舗利用に配慮して訪問する。": "Episode 12. The exterior of the craft store “Shimaya” appears. Visits are made with consideration for the store’s business hours and customer experience.",
    "第2話。横浜に関係する場面で山下公園の海沿いの景観が登場。": "Episode 2. The seaside scenery of Yamashita Park appears in a scene set in Yokohama.",
